{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-08-10 09:11:00', 'title': 'EASTERN BAND OF CHEROKEE INDIANS JOINS CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT AS JOINT VENTURE PARTNER IN $650 MILLION CAESARS VIRGINIA DEVELOPMENT', 'text': 'DANVILLE, VA. , AUG. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS") AND THE EASTERN BAND OF CHEROKEE INDIANS ("EBCI") TODAY ANNOUNCED THEIR PARTNERSHIP IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF CAESARS VIRGINIA, WHICH OFFICIALLY BREAKS GROUND IN DANVILLE THIS WEEK.'}